      en: ["The church was designated a UNESCO World Heritage site in 1994.", "Architect Jan Blažej Santini-Aichel designed the building.", "The church is built on a five-pointed star ground plan.", "The number five is the central symbolic element throughout.", "The surrounding ambulatory forms a ten-pointed star.", "The church was officially consecrated in 1722."],
